WEBVTT

00:13:58.315 --> 00:14:01.535
we also imagine that the architecture
can adapt to any culture,

00:14:01.559 --> 00:14:04.464
so imagine, like,
a Middle Eastern floating city

00:14:04.488 --> 00:14:07.307
or Southeast Asian floating city

00:14:07.331 --> 00:14:11.408
or maybe a Scandinavian
floating city one day.

00:14:12.412 --> 00:14:14.840
So maybe just to conclude.

00:14:16.142 --> 00:14:19.570
The human body is 70 percent water.

00:14:20.134 --> 00:14:23.610
And the surface of our planet
is 70 percent water.

00:14:24.623 --> 00:14:25.773
And it's rising.

00:14:26.148 --> 00:14:28.727
And even if the whole world
woke up tomorrow

00:14:28.751 --> 00:14:31.036
and became carbon-neutral over night,